**Providers considered but excluded:** Mux and Cloudflare Stream were initially evaluated but excluded from the final benchmark — both produce H.264-only static MP4 downloads with no quality controls. AV1 and H.265 are only available via streaming, not as downloadable files, making fair comparison with the other providers impossible.

