## 3. Methodology

### 3.1 Test Content

{{ stats.n_clips }} source videos selected to represent the range of content complexity encountered in production:

| Clip | Vertical | Resolution | Duration | SI | TI | Source | License |
|------|----------|------------|----------|----|----|--------|---------|
