{% endfor %}

**Selection criteria:** Clips were chosen to cover a diverse range of spatial and temporal complexity across each vertical. Synthetic test sequences (ITU reference clips, Blender demos) were avoided in favor of content representative of real production workloads.

**Input preparation:** All source files were re-encoded to H.264 CRF 18, no audio, MP4 container. Videos longer than 120 seconds were trimmed from the start. Pixel aspect ratio is normalized to 1:1 (square pixels), so encoders that auto-rescale non-square sources produce outputs at the same dimensions as the reference and VMAF can be measured directly.

